{"pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Crane Inspection Report\u000aAdrighem & Aldibiki — Site 14, New Cairo\u000a\u000a1. Summary\u000aThe Liebherr LTM 1090 was inspected on 12 September 2026. All load tests passed, and the \u000aoutriggers were checked at full extension. The crane is fit for service until the next yearly check.\u000a\u000aThis paragraph is justified so both edges line up. It is long enough to wrap over several lines, \u000awhich shows whether the spacing between the lines and the words is kept the same as in the  \u000aoriginal document after the conversion.\u000a\u000a2. Checks done\u000a Hydraulic hoses and fittings\u000a Wire rope and hook block\u000a Load moment indicator (LMI)\u000a\u000a1. Extend all outriggers\u000a2. Lift the test load at 10 m\u000a3. Slew 360° slowly\u000a\u000aNote: the operator must keep the logbook in the cab at all times.\u000a\u000aWeather on the day: wind 18 km/h, dry. The lift plan was approved by the site manager.\u000a\u000aWarning: never lift above 80% of the chart in wind over 30 km/h.\u000a\u000a3. Results\u000aTest Load (t) Result\u000aMain boom 25.0 Pass\u000aJib 6.5 Pass\u000aOutriggers — Pass\u000a\u000aFigure 1 — Loads by boom length","scan":false,"lines":[{"y":92.55,"x":189.40,"e":422.67,"s":22,"b":true,"i":false,"r":false,"f":"BAAAAA+LiberationSerif-Bold","c":0,"sp":[[189.40,"Crane Inspection Report",22,[[189.40,"Crane",1,0,0,248.01],[253.51,"Inspection",1,0,0,351.23],[356.73,"Report",1,0,0,422.67]]]]},{"y":122.25,"x":201.80,"e":410.26,"s":12,"b":false,"i":true,"r":false,"f":"CAAAAA+LiberationSerif-Italic","c":0,"sp":[[201.80,"Adrighem & Aldibiki — Site 14, New Cairo",12,[[201.80,"Adrighem",0,1,0,249.09],[252.09,"&",0,1,0,261.42],[264.42,"Aldibiki",0,1,0,302.35],[305.35,"—",0,1,0,316.02],[319.02,"Site",0,1,0,336.98],[339.98,"14,",0,1,0,354.98],[357.98,"New",0,1,0,379.28],[382.28,"Cairo",0,1,0,410.26]]]]},{"y":163.90,"x":90.10,"e":184.64,"s":14,"b":true,"i":false,"r":false,"f":"DAAAAA+DejaVuSans-Bold","c":3563409,"